{"segs": ["PA_ja_9:1.4"], "en": "it is time for my renunciation.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_9:2.1"], "en": "Thus ends the ninth Jātaka, the Maghadeva Jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
